      "text": "## Bases and Sub-bases"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md#017",
      "path": [
        "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:02-topological-spaces, git-history:topology:02-topological-spaces]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md",
        "concepts": "[topological, spaces]",
        "current_path": "topology/02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:topological-spaces",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[topological, spaces]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topological Spaces",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nBASIS for topology τ:\n  Collection B of open sets such that every open U = union of elements of B.\n  B is a basis iff: (1) X = ∪B (covers X) and (2) B₁, B₂ ∈ B, x ∈ B₁∩B₂ → ∃B₃ ∈ B: x ∈ B₃ ⊆ B₁∩B₂."
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md#018",
      "path": [
        "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:topology:02-topological-spaces, git-history:topology:02-topological-spaces]",
        "canonical_path": "topology/02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md",
        "concepts": "[topological, spaces]",
        "current_path": "topology/02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md",
        "id": "maxim:topology:topological-spaces",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "topology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[topological, spaces]",
        "section": "topology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topological Spaces",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Generating a topology from a basis:\n  τ = {∪ of elements of B} (all unions of basis elements)."
    },
    {
