      "text": "Examples:\n  R: B = {(a,b) : a < b} generates Euclidean topology.\n  Rⁿ: B = {open balls} generates Euclidean topology.\n  Order topology: B = {(a,b), (a,∞), (-∞,b)} generates order topology."
    },
