      "text": "SECOND COUNTABLE: X has a countable basis.\n  Rⁿ: yes (open balls with rational center and radius).\n  Uncountable discrete space: no.\n  Second countable → separable (has countable dense subset).\n  Metric + separable ↔ second countable.\n```"
