        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topological Spaces",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLES:\n  Hausdorff (T₂): Rⁿ, metric spaces, manifolds.\n  T₁ but not T₂: cofinite topology on infinite set.\n  T₀ but not T₁: Sierpiński space ({0,1}, τ = {∅,{1},{0,1}}).\n  Not T₀: indiscrete topology on any set with ≥ 2 elements.\n  Zariski topology: T₁ (affine n-space) but generally not T₂."
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md#028",
      "path": [
        "02-TOPOLOGICAL-SPACES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
