        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Topological Spaces",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "METRIC SPACES ARE NORMAL (T₄):\n  Urysohn's metrization theorem: regular + second countable → metrizable.\n  Nagata-Smirnov: normal + second countable → metrizable."
    },
    {
